# HashRouter does not need a /* → index.html rewrite.
# That splat was returning HTML for /assets/*.js (MIME type text/html), which blanked the site.
#
# public-web/download.html is served at /download by Cloudflare Pages.
# Do not rewrite /download → download.html or /index.html.
# The html rewrite 308-loops, and index.html sent guests to the login app.
